sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant PIC as PartyInviteController
  participant NT as NetworkTransitionService
  participant HCS as HostConnectionService
  participant NM as NetworkManager
  PIC->>PIC: SetFadeImmediate(1) + ArmSplashFade + Unpause
  PIC->>NT: ShutdownAsync (8s timeout)
  NT->>NM: Shutdown() — wait for full reset
  PIC->>HCS: AcceptInviteAsync — publish acceptance, JoinById(host)
  PIC->>NT: WaitForClientConnectionAsync (8s)
  NT->>NM: poll IsConnectedClient
  PIC->>NT: WaitForSceneSyncAsync (8s)
  PIC->>PIC: WaitForClientReadyAsync (10s — local vessel spawns)
  PIC-->>PIC: OnPartyJoinCompleted → party UI refresh
  Note over PIC,NM: any timeout → RecoverFromFailedTransitionAsync → clean solo Menu_Main
